sionate gamer and you want to  know what the best experiences are  across all of gaming then gamespot's 25  best games of 2016 is for you think of  the platform nominees as your guide as  to what's the best  for your system while the overall ranked  25 best games of 2016 list tells you  what order you could play them in so  join us over the next few weeks as we  unveil our picks for the top games of  the year you'll agree with some of our  choices and you'll probably disagree  with a lot of them and that's okay  that's really half the fun of all these  things please let us know in the  comments or on Twitter or on Facebook  what you think we got right and what you  would have picked  you

